+09:37 - John Deere 220 Power-Flex Disk (Ertl 1/16 toy)
 - Item: Ertl 1/16 John Deere 220 Power-Flex Center-Fold Disk, JD-583-E, made USA 1979.
 - Stamped "7303-583" / printed "0385" are Ertl mold/date codes (583 = JD-583-E model).
 - Yellow-top-box version with green gangs; collectors distinguish variants. Deere parts manual: 220 Disk (Power-Flex Center-Fold).
 
-- Note: 52040 is Dyersville, IA zip code (Ertl's hometown) on base castings; also reused as a stock # (JD 52040 tractors, 52040 semi sets). Disk codes: 0385 = day 38 of 1985 (Feb 7); 2135 = day 213 of 1985 (Aug 1). JD-583 stayed in production into the mid-1980s.
